# This branch exists to hold captured market data, so data/ is NOT ignored here.
# It carries opening lines read from Kalshi's public board: prices anyone can
# query, with no account, no key and nothing about who placed what.
#
# The operator's own record stays out. A bet log carries positions and fill
# prices and belongs nowhere near a public branch.
data/bets*
data/*bets*
__pycache__/
*.pyc
